== Description ==

'''Pulley''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 3 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Simple Generator]], [[Simple Motor]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

